        // freely — only the bass is fixed. Without this the cascade can only
        // shift a whole voicing by octaves, which on a triad-heavy chart
        // leaves it almost nothing to choose from (measured: This Love barely
        // improved before this). One voice moved at a time keeps the
        // candidate set small and the voicings playable.
